    "enUS": {
      "description": "Meat is well and good, but a varied diet makes the body stronger.\r\n\r\nWinter squid are in season, and can be fished from the coasts here in Azshara. I never took to angling myself. I much prefer the safety of land. Although, were you to fish some up, or obtain them via some other means, I would greatly appreciate it.",
      "objectiveLines": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "{current}/{required} Raw Winter Squid",
          "type": "item"
